at in rivers of liquid mana.</p>\n<p><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Epic, ethereal, high-stakes, and unstable.</p>\n<p><strong>Significance:</strong> The site of the God-Engine and the final confrontation where the world’s fate is decided.</p>\n<hr />\n<h3>Act Structure</h3>\n<h4>Act 1: The Fading Embers</h4>\n<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Establish the dying world, introduce the conflict between magic and tech, and unite the trio.</p>\n<p><strong>Estimated Scenes:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>Key Developments:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Discovery of the first Shard</li>\n<li>Malakor’s forces attack the Citadel</li>\n<li>The trio flees Aethelgard on a prototype airship</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Act 2: The Divided Path</h4>\n<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Explore the themes of sacrifice and the cost of progress while gathering the remaining Shards.</p>\n<p><strong>Estimated Scenes:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>Key Developments:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Navigation of the Sunken Forge and discovery of ancient history</li>\n<li>Internal conflict peaks between Elara and Kaelen</li>\n<li>Obtaining the second Shard after a confrontation with Malakor</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Act 3: The Convergence</h4>\n<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> The final push to the Nexus, the ultimate sacrifice, and the resolution of the world’s future.</p>\n<p><strong>Estimated Scenes:</strong> 4</p>\n<p><strong>Key Developments:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Assault on Malakor’s aerial fleet</li>\n<li>Final battle at the God-Engine</li>\n<li>The player's ultimate choice regarding the Shards and the world's future</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Status:</strong> ✅ Pass 1 Complete</p>\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"tab-content\" data-tab=\"Markdown\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-markdown\">## The Crystal Shards of Eldoria\n\n**Premise:** In a world caught between a fading magical past and a rising industrial future, a descendant of the ancient Crystal-Keepers must stabilize the Shards of Eldoria to prevent the 'Great Fading' while deciding